# Rendered sprite output IS committed, for now. ART_PIPELINE.md §9 wants CI
# to regenerate it from art/src/*.blend, but the .blend sources are too large
# for git (see below) so CI has nothing to render from -- and without the PNGs
# the deployed build falls back to procedural shapes. They are small (~3 MB),
# and tools/quantize_sprites.py keeps them passing the art gate. Revisit when
# sources move to LFS and the rig runs in CI.

# Blender sources are NOT in git: they run to hundreds of MB each and blow
# past GitHub's 100 MB hard limit. ART_PIPELINE.md §8 still requires sources
# to accompany contributed art -- when the pipeline goes live they belong in
# Git LFS, decimated and licence-checked first (§7). Keep them on disk or in
# asset storage until then.
art/src/*.blend
art/src/*.blend1
# Blender auto-backups: never wanted, anywhere.
*.blend1
